usage: mktag [options] <src> [<dir>] [<rest>...]

write a tag file

arguments:
  <src>               the file to read
  [<dir>]             where to put it (default .)
  [<rest>...]

options:
       --help         show this help
  --q, --quiet        say nothing on success
       --dry-run
  --o, --out PATH     where to write
       --host HOST    (default 127.0.0.1)
       --tag TAG...   tags to add
  --w, --width WIDTH  wrap at this column (default 80)
       --scale SCALE  (default 7.5)
       --count COUNT
